<graph edgedefault="undirected"><node id="&quot;THE PATIENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A 21-year-old sexually active male presenting with symptoms including fever, pain during urination, and inflammation and pain in the right knee."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-81dbd4ebb0a9594a1876cd2e59a5c3a0</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;THE PHYSICIAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A medical professional who orders diagnostic tests and antibiotic therapy for the patient based on the clinical presentation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-81dbd4ebb0a9594a1876cd2e59a5c3a0</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RIGHT KNEE INFLAMMATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A medical condition characterized by inflammation and pain in the right knee, identified through the patient's complaint and confirmed by joint fluid culture."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-81dbd4ebb0a9594a1876cd2e59a5c3a0</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FEVER AND DYSURIA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Symptomatic occurrences involving fever and pain during urination reported by the patient, indicating a systemic or urinary infection."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-81dbd4ebb0a9594a1876cd2e59a5c3a0</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;JOINT FLUID CULTURE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A diagnostic procedure involving analyzing joint fluid to identify bacteria that do not ferment maltose and lack a polysaccharide capsule."&lt;SEP&gt;"A diagnostic procedure performed to analyze the joint fluid for specific bacterial characteristics."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-81dbd4ebb0a9594a1876cd2e59a5c3a0</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ANTIBIOTIC THERAPY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The medical intervention prescribed to treat the identified infection, blocking cell wall synthesis."&lt;SEP&gt;"Treatment administered by the physician involving medication blocks cell wall synthesis to address the bacterial infection."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-81dbd4ebb0a9594a1876cd2e59a5c3a0</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 0}]</data>
</node>
