<edge source="&quot;THE PATIENT&quot;" target="&quot;FEVER AND DYSURIA&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The patient reports fever and pain during urination as presenting symptoms.</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-81dbd4ebb0a9594a1876cd2e59a5c3a0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE PATIENT&quot;" target="&quot;RIGHT KNEE INFLAMMATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The patient complains of inflammation and pain in the right knee along with other symptoms.</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-81dbd4ebb0a9594a1876cd2e59a5c3a0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE PATIENT&quot;" target="&quot;THE PHYSICIAN&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The physician is responsible for treating the patient and ordering interventions.</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-81dbd4ebb0a9594a1876cd2e59a5c3a0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE PHYSICIAN&quot;" target="&quot;JOINT FLUID CULTURE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The physician orders a culture of the joint fluid as part of the diagnostic workup.</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-81dbd4ebb0a9594a1876cd2e59a5c3a0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE PHYSICIAN&quot;" target="&quot;ANTIBIOTIC THERAPY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The physician prescribes antibiotic therapy as the treatment course.</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-81dbd4ebb0a9594a1876cd2e59a5c3a0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RIGHT KNEE INFLAMMATION&quot;" target="&quot;JOINT FLUID CULTURE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The culture is performed on the joint fluid associated with the patient's right knee inflammation to identify the pathogen.</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-81dbd4ebb0a9594a1876cd2e59a5c3a0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RIGHT KNEE INFLAMMATION&quot;" target="&quot;ANTIBIOTIC THERAPY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The antibiotic therapy is intended to resolve the inflammation and pain in the right knee.</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-81dbd4ebb0a9594a1876cd2e59a5c3a0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;JOINT FLUID CULTURE&quot;" target="&quot;ANTIBIOTIC THERAPY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The results of the joint fluid culture inform the choice of antibiotic therapy.</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-81dbd4ebb0a9594a1876cd2e59a5c3a0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ANTIBIOTIC THERAPY&quot;" target="&quot;PHYSICIAN&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The physician orders the antibiotic therapy for the patient.</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-81dbd4ebb0a9594a1876cd2e59a5c3a0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ANTIBIOTIC THERAPY&quot;" target="&quot;PATIENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The patient receives the antibiotic therapy to resolve the infection.</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-81dbd4ebb0a9594a1876cd2e59a5c3a0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ANTIBIOTIC THERAPY&quot;" target="&quot;GENTAMICIN&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Gentamicin is a specific option included in the potential antibiotic therapy regimen.</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-81dbd4ebb0a9594a1876cd2e59a5c3a0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ANTIBIOTIC THERAPY&quot;" target="&quot;CIPROFLOXACIN&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Ciprofloxacin is a specific option included in the potential antibiotic therapy regimen.</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-81dbd4ebb0a9594a1876cd2e59a5c3a0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ANTIBIOTIC THERAPY&quot;" target="&quot;CEFTRIAXONE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Ceftriaxone is a specific option included in the potential antibiotic therapy regimen.</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-81dbd4ebb0a9594a1876cd2e59a5c3a0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ANTIBIOTIC THERAPY&quot;" target="&quot;TRIMETHOPRIM&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Trimethoprim is a specific option included in the potential antibiotic therapy regimen.</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-81dbd4ebb0a9594a1876cd2e59a5c3a0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PATIENT&quot;" target="&quot;FEVER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The patient reports fever as one of the primary presenting symptoms.</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-81dbd4ebb0a9594a1876cd2e59a5c3a0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PATIENT&quot;" target="&quot;URINATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The patient experiences pain during urination, linking the activity to their symptoms.</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-81dbd4ebb0a9594a1876cd2e59a5c3a0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PATIENT&quot;" target="&quot;RIGHT KNEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The pain and inflammation are localized to the right knee of the patient.</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-81dbd4ebb0a9594a1876cd2e59a5c3a0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PATIENT&quot;" target="&quot;BACTERIA&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A culture of the patient's joint fluid shows the presence of bacteria.</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-81dbd4ebb0a9594a1876cd2e59a5c3a0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RIGHT KNEE&quot;" target="&quot;JOINT FLUID&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The joint fluid is extracted from the right knee for analysis.</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-81dbd4ebb0a9594a1876cd2e59a5c3a0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;URINATION&quot;" target="&quot;INFLAMMATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Pain during urination is linked to the infection and associated inflammation.</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-81dbd4ebb0a9594a1876cd2e59a5c3a0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FEVER&quot;" target="&quot;JOINT FLUID&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Fever is a systemic event associated with the infection found in the joint fluid.</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-81dbd4ebb0a9594a1876cd2e59a5c3a0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BACTERIA&quot;" target="&quot;INFLAMMATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The bacteria found in the joint fluid are causing the inflammation and pain.</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-81dbd4ebb0a9594a1876cd2e59a5c3a0</data>
</edge>
